      "message": "ok, the same code configures the codec C2PortTunneledModeTuning::output before querying C2PortTunnelHandleTuning::output. In general, was wondering if it would be better to check for the configuration value than checking the result(C2PortTunnelHandleTuning::output) of the configuration? Was only referring to C2 configuration for tunnelled codecs here\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/av/media/codec2/core/include/C2Config.h;drc\u003d340c3f680a2f4834658124f9b7cb0bbe14f1ddce;l\u003d2515\n\nThanks",
